637064971_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MzA2NjI1NzQ0NjAwNTY2NjE4MjIzNzAyMDQyMzM2ODE2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=IyIwMYOWGz8Q7kNvwG4zduS&_nc_oc=AdpyvFpVnrO5MRjHlwIMu7y1POO6Td26ovZ9GDbKsbXhI1BEaYk-jUlRPeji4HinNdk&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=PO2GrGWw0DwmM3ImI9DNjw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJNGE3X5zyShRVz53OZ_cW8upgRW3RAREyzvS9EJUBh_g&oe=6AAC7F23", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQP5_lLzYve0UDLG3WZWpEUkmpt-eyO9aCTODTaLSFAfwjKH-6mNI18ep97NvNU6JdPxllaIkI6sq_D6LrrpelTvnjUWYbjWDbqGIqa7V93ADg.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=d17R3t_t8P0Q7kNvwHFobKH&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=PO2GrGWw0DwmM3ImI9DNjw&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQKvuUHfo-CQ4DLzPQeNAaM2969P72Hm4Fj3_dOtjXqhbQ&oe=6AAC9BCF", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "organizingspacesbykim", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "39557710030494711"}, "ownerUsername": "organizingspacesbykim", "ownerFullName": "Kim | Organizing Spaces by Kim", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 5727, "likes": 61, "comments": 26}, {"date": "2026-09-06", "plays": 6793, "likes": 65, "comments": 29}, {"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 8667, "likes": 66, "comments": 29}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Six attractions under one roof, but can we actually do them all in one visit? We came to Gamescape by Cinemark in Greenville with one mission. Do everything. We punched things off in the arcade and it didn't take long for our family competition to start. There were so many games to choose from with something for every age. Pulling them away from the arcade wasn't easy, but once we discovered this was not your average bowling alley, they were all in. The interactive lanes and games made it s